      <activity id="aaea6bc7-16d2-5b57-9a45-1bfdd43c7cac" activityNameId="12c08a8a-9b9e-517f-8f0a-841fec81df4e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal of heat distribution system, office building Fribourg</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal of heat distribution system, office building Fribourg
Disposal of components for the heat distribution system;
UUID: e33b55bb-a16b-4d2c-895b-cbf4b424c761
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland.
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal pieces, copper in cables and electronic devices are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Waste-specific calculation based on input data from call of bids for a heating system of a specific building. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e33b55bb-a16b-4d2c-895b-cbf4b424c761.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
